-- Rows that arrive after Deskmate started reading (test/imessage.test.ts adds them to the fixture database).
-- 2: a note to self typed on the phone (sent copy), text only in attributedBody
-- 3: the received copy of the same note to self (a twin)
-- 4: the user texting a friend: never read as a command
